files: infra/lib/api-stack.ts (tenant-data role section rewritten)
iam-design: trust = resolver exec roles (CompositePrincipal) + sts:TagSession
  with aws:RequestTag/tenantId = '*' (bare tenantId, FF-3);
  inline policy = GetItem/PutItem/Query/TransactWriteItems on tableArn +
  tableArn/index/* with ForAllValues:StringLike dynamodb:LeadingKeys =
  TENANT#${aws:PrincipalTag/tenantId}#*;
  KMS decrypt on DDB CMK.
  GSI grant included per FF-5 design constraint (all GSI*PK TENANT#-prefixed).
